    "Input: center_x = 16.0, center_y = 16.0, base_size = 16.0, aspect_ratios = [0.5, 1.0, 2.0], scales = [1.0]\n\nOutput: [[10.3431, 4.6863, 21.6569, 27.3137], [8.0, 8.0, 24.0, 24.0], [4.6863, 10.3431, 27.3137, 21.6569]]\n\nExplanation: Evaluated cv_anchor_generation under standard test conditions."
